       <t indent="0" pn="section-appendix.b-16">The calculated value is then compared with the value of
 &quot;code_challenge&quot;:</t>
-      <t indent="0" pn="section-appendix.b-17">BASE64URL-ENCODE(SHA256(ASCII(code_verifier))) == code_challenge</t>
